      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_3ba9223f",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "general internet audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general internet audience familiar with cultural references to religion, celebrity imagery, and internet humor tropes. The use of a well-known actor (John Malkovich) and a juxtaposed religious scene with police is intended to provoke thought or amusement among viewers who understand the contrast being made. The target community includes individuals who engage with meme culture, are familiar with the phrase 'labor of love' in the context of religion, and are capable of interpreting visual irony or satire.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
